#: functions.inc.php:521
msgid ""
"If you do not know the password for this user you can change it in the User "
"Password field above"
msgstr "如果您不知道此使用者的密碼，可以在上面的「使用者密碼」欄位中變更"

#: views/userman_hook.php:18
msgid "Inherit"
msgstr "繼承"

#: functions.inc.php:554
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Makes this extension a full user in %s. Full users have access to all the "
"fuctionality in %s that the current license allows. The amount of full users "
"allowed in %s is restricted via the license. If you mark this user as a full "
"user and there are no more user licenes available the user will remain a "
"lite user."
msgstr ""
"將此分機設為 %s 中的完整使用者。完整使用者可存取目前授權允許的 %s 所有功能。%s 中允許的完整使用者數量受授權限制。如果您將此使用者標記為完整使用者，但已無可用的使用者授權，該使用者將維持為輕量使用者。"

#: functions.inc.php:546
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Makes this extension automatically answer the initial call received from the "
"system when performing an origination within %s. Only works with Aastra, "
"Grandstream, Linksys, Polycom, and Snom phones."
msgstr ""
"讓此分機在 %s 中執行起撥時，自動接聽來自系統的首通來電。僅適用於 Aastra、Grandstream、Linksys、Polycom 和 Snom 話機。"

#: functions.inc.php:545
#, php-format
msgid "Makes this extension available in %s"
msgstr "讓此分機在 %s 中可用"

#: functions.inc.php:407
#, php-format
msgid "Makes this user available in %s"
msgstr "讓此使用者在 %s 中可用"

#: functions.inc.php:573
#, php-format
msgid "Manages alternative phone numbers for this %s user."
msgstr "管理此 %s 使用者的替代電話號碼。"

#: views/userman_hook.php:15
msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

#: functions.inc.php:594
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Please specify a password for the %s user or uncheck \"Create User\" under "
"\"%s User Settings\""
msgstr "請為 %s 使用者指定密碼，或取消勾選「%s 使用者設定」下的「建立使用者」"

#: functions.inc.php:556
#, php-format
msgid "Specifies the password to be used for the %s User"
msgstr "指定要用於 %s 使用者的密碼"

#: functions.inc.php:569
msgid ""
"Specifies which extensions will be bound to the $cxpanelBrandName user "
"created for this extension. \"Self\" refers to this extension"
msgstr "指定哪些分機將綁定為此分機建立的 $cxpanelBrandName 使用者。「Self」指此分機"

#: functions.inc.php:519
msgid "The inital password for this user is set to"
msgstr "此使用者的初始密碼設定為"

#: functions.inc.php:521
msgid "The inital password for this user was never created or has been changed"
msgstr "此使用者的初始密碼從未建立或已被變更"

#: cxpanel.i18n.php:8
msgid ""
"This module automatically configures the operator panel to reflect the PBX "
"configuration."
msgstr "此模組會自動設定操作面板以反映 PBX 組態。"

#: functions.inc.php:570
msgid "User Extensions"
msgstr "使用者分機"

#: functions.inc.php:556
msgid "User Password"
msgstr "使用者密碼"

#: functions.inc.php:555
msgid ""
"When checked the new specified password will be sent to the email cofigured "
"in the voicemail settings. No email will be sent if no email address is "
"specified or the password is not changing."
msgstr "勾選後，新指定的密碼將傳送到語音信箱設定中設定的電子郵件。如果未指定電子郵件地址或密碼未變更，將不會傳送電子郵件。"

